### set with a name and a value
set retries 42
>>> SC2121 1:5

### set with spaced equals
set retries = 42
>>> SC2121 1:5

### set with an assignment word
set retries=42
>>> SC2121 1:5

### set after double dash
set -- if=/dev/null
>>> none

### single-quoted assignment text
set 'retries=42'
>>> none

### bare set
set
>>> none
